 align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.34 (0.17&#x02013;0.47)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><label/><p>Values are the group median (25th&#x02013;75th percentile).</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote4"><label>&#x0002a;</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.01 compared to FAB M1&#x0002f;2.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Correlation between mRNA level of potential resistance factors and <italic>in vitro</italic> sensitivity to deoxynucleoside analogues (expressed as LC<sub>50</sub> values) in 50 paediatric AML samples obtained at initial diagnosis</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="center" char="."/><col align="center" char="."/><col align="center" char="."/><col align="center" char="."/><col align="center" char="."/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>Ara-C</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>2-CdA</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>DAC</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>F-ara-A</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>dFdC</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>hENT1</italic></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>r</italic><sub>p</sub></td><td align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x02212;0.46<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x02212;0.30<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x02212;0.29<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top"